00:53:41.430 --> 00:53:42.230
Are you sure?

00:53:42.630 --> 00:53:42.990
Yes.

00:53:43.070 --> 00:53:43.210
Yes?

00:53:43.590 --> 00:53:44.250
Okay, cool.

00:53:46.340 --> 00:53:47.260
Everything on a white horse.

00:54:44.680 --> 00:54:45.980
I don't recommend you to say that, what do you mean?

00:54:46.020 --> 00:54:48.860
Just so you know, I'm an alimetic person

00:54:48.860 --> 00:54:50.860
Just watch Pak Chor Kudas, it's like I'm teaching

00:54:54.790 --> 00:54:56.110
Hahaha, the fun is fun

00:55:37.040 --> 00:55:39.380
That white horse is Ati. He must be the winner.

00:55:40.690 --> 00:55:41.610
That horse is Uda, Ati.

00:55:45.040 --> 00:55:47.690
Let's go, Ati. We came here to watch the parade.

00:55:48.010 --> 00:55:52.480
I came here to meet Zainudi.

00:56:01.340 --> 00:56:01.900
Why are you blushing?

00:56:02.200 --> 00:56:04.730
Am I the one who's blushing?

00:56:05.700 --> 00:56:07.240
I'm sorry, I was too hasty.

00:56:07.260 --> 00:56:09.450
Please continue until it's over.

00:56:09.650 --> 00:56:11.870
So I can be in your eyes right away.

00:56:12.010 --> 00:56:14.330
I can't.

00:56:15.000 --> 00:56:15.820
Let's go together.

00:56:16.020 --> 00:56:17.120
We have to go together.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:02.910
We're all going home. The most important thing is your health, okay?

00:57:03.150 --> 00:57:06.490
As long as I have my blood, I know I can't go home.

00:57:06.730 --> 00:57:08.900
Well, that's not the same as a friend.

00:57:09.180 --> 00:57:13.750
One is happy, everyone is happy. One is sick, everyone is thirsty. Come on, Sofyan.

00:57:15.650 --> 00:57:16.870
Hayati, I'm going home.

00:57:17.450 --> 00:57:27.460
My love, Hayati. You are the one I know, the honest girl.

00:57:28.900 --> 00:57:29.920
The holy flower of Batima.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:33.260
The love of my heart that released me at the end of the road

00:57:33.730 --> 00:57:37.560
Forgive me, Hayati, if you keep talking

00:57:38.120 --> 00:57:41.600
Because true love should not be hypocritical, Hayati

00:57:41.600 --> 00:57:44.600
I was beaten to see your clothes

00:57:45.640 --> 00:57:47.680
How great is it to be a modern person?

00:57:48.840 --> 00:57:50.440
Haji Agus Salim is very modern

00:57:50.440 --> 00:57:54.010
But still a man with a black scarf and a black shirt

00:57:55.340 --> 00:57:58.880
Adindaku Hayati, why have your clothes changed?

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:00.520
Where are your clothes?

00:58:00.980 --> 00:58:04.720
Yesterday, Adinda wore clothes that she rarely wears.

00:58:05.350 --> 00:58:05.730
Her nails are narrow.

00:58:08.100 --> 00:58:09.740
And Adinda brought those clothes to the crowd.

00:58:11.390 --> 00:58:14.120
Adinda, wear your clothes again.

00:58:14.970 --> 00:58:16.390
You're still beautiful with those clothes.

00:58:17.100 --> 00:58:21.250
Cis, do you really think that your lover is Ayati?

00:58:21.430 --> 00:58:25.960
Like Zainuddin, if you become her husband, you'll be cheated, right?

00:58:26.260 --> 00:58:29.260
You'll be locked up in the house like an Arab.

00:58:31.280 --> 00:58:35.350
You can't get sunburned, you can't have someone else take care of your beauty.

00:58:35.890 --> 00:58:39.090
If you go, the house key is under it.

00:58:39.290 --> 00:58:40.730
You just stay in the kitchen.

00:58:41.310 --> 00:58:44.810
You have to cover your face with a blanket.

00:58:45.030 --> 00:58:47.720
Like a bandila horse, you have to be careful with the blindfold.

00:58:48.240 --> 00:58:49.860
That's not good, Hadijah.

00:58:50.830 --> 00:58:55.890
No matter how bad the situation is that you said, you haven't introduced him.

00:58:56.680 --> 00:58:57.980
Your accusation is too much.

00:59:00.120 --> 00:59:01.780
Zainuddin's heart is kind to Khadijah

00:59:01.780 --> 00:59:04.540
He's just in love

00:59:05.340 --> 00:59:07.770
He's jealous

00:59:08.380 --> 00:59:13.340
Before I go back to Batipu, I have to meet him

00:59:13.340 --> 00:59:16.640
I'm afraid he misunderstands

00:59:16.640 --> 00:59:19.690
He thinks I've changed

00:59:19.690 --> 00:59:26.550
Yes, even if he looks at you in the eyes, he can mess with you

00:59:26.550 --> 00:59:29.510
It's his fault

00:59:31.080 --> 00:59:34.140
No, Odija. Zainuddin is a good person.

00:59:34.260 --> 00:59:35.460
He's good enough.

00:59:38.070 --> 00:59:43.750
Ati, nowadays, we need a husband who is able to satisfy our needs.

00:59:43.910 --> 00:59:47.810
If he's a merchant, a merchant who owns a grocery store.

00:59:47.950 --> 00:59:51.550
If he's a clerk, his rank must be high.

00:59:52.860 --> 00:59:56.360
Everyone's love eventually depends on money, Ati.

00:59:56.400 --> 00:59:58.280
No, Odija. You're wrong.

01:00:00.190 --> 01:00:05.090
I don't love them more than I love them when I get my money.

01:00:05.410 --> 01:00:08.870
They are the value in my house.

01:00:09.270 --> 01:00:12.930
You can be able to endure all the suffering.

01:00:13.230 --> 01:00:15.840
What about your children?

01:00:16.080 --> 01:00:17.820
How about the money?

01:00:17.980 --> 01:00:19.560
Can they go to school?

01:00:19.840 --> 01:00:26.930
My dear friend, I love you.

01:00:28.840 --> 01:00:29.400
Ajis.

01:00:30.280 --> 01:00:34.860
I'm sure you won't refuse if you're with Hayati.

01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:42.560
Honestly, in this week's meeting, I'm impressed by his behavior.

01:00:42.680 --> 01:00:46.100
He's pretty, kind, and polite.

01:00:46.640 --> 01:00:48.820
He's a good husband for you.

01:00:48.980 --> 01:00:53.620
And we'll be lucky if we have a family with him.

01:00:54.040 --> 01:00:56.860
The village girl is too stubborn when she's brought to the city.

01:00:58.670 --> 01:00:59.810
Just by looking at her face, it's already...

01:01:01.280 --> 01:01:02.800
How do you get a big house like Padang?

01:01:03.410 --> 01:01:04.530
It's easy to fix.

01:01:04.890 --> 01:01:06.760
If we polish the bandana and gold,

01:01:06.980 --> 01:01:08.180
it will be convenient and satisfying,

01:01:08.500 --> 01:01:09.560
so people will be modern.

01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:11.590
After getting married,

01:01:12.310 --> 01:01:14.410
hijab will make her look more like a city girl than a city girl.

01:01:15.490 --> 01:01:16.670
Perhaps there is an engagement.

01:01:17.360 --> 01:01:18.060
Alunba engagement,

01:01:18.280 --> 01:01:20.990
there is a little love with a rough child.

01:01:21.110 --> 01:01:22.640
The news is that the child is thrown away.

01:01:22.880 --> 01:01:24.140
It's not allowed to be with an old man.

01:01:31.880 --> 01:01:35.460
I'm here. I'm here to study with Sarong.

01:01:35.580 --> 01:01:40.850
That's it. Stop fooling around with your Dutch friends, Jis.

01:01:41.460 --> 01:01:57.310
They're still people of Minang. Minang, Hayat.

01:02:01.600 --> 01:02:03.660
Maybe he's interested in the men in the horse carriage, Uncle.

01:02:03.860 --> 01:02:05.780
How could it be, Pak Mula?

01:02:06.610 --> 01:02:11.510
A woman as kind as that has sworn loyalty and kept her promise for a few days.

01:02:12.580 --> 01:02:14.820
Three letters, there's no reply.

01:02:15.280 --> 01:02:20.870
Ah, there's a post, Uncle. Maybe it's a letter from Hayati.

01:02:20.970 --> 01:02:27.500
Who's this?

01:02:27.720 --> 01:02:28.300
It's me, Pak.

01:02:37.800 --> 01:02:38.280
Thank you.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:04.180
Oh, there's a postcard too. I got the money.

01:03:05.510 --> 01:03:07.710
I'll pay for it later when I eat at Lapau.

01:03:07.790 --> 01:03:09.530
And I bought a cigarette too.

01:03:09.890 --> 01:03:11.580
From who, Angku?

01:03:11.740 --> 01:03:24.140
From Makassar.

01:03:26.760 --> 01:03:27.600
Daeng Masija.

01:03:28.620 --> 01:03:29.800
I'm sorry, I don't have money.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:34.360
This is the way that Allah will guide us.

01:03:34.700 --> 01:03:39.630
In the language of the Prophet, Allah is the only one who can guide us.

01:03:40.590 --> 01:03:43.060
So, let me read this words.

01:03:43.440 --> 01:03:44.560
Allah will guide us.

01:03:45.610 --> 01:03:49.300
I believe that you have come to the right path.

01:03:49.300 --> 01:03:51.910
When you have paid the price of your life,

01:03:52.130 --> 01:03:54.660
you will go to the right path.

01:03:55.930 --> 01:03:58.730
I will take you to the court and make you pay for what you have done.

01:04:01.050 --> 01:04:03.780
This is your father, Balak Segambutta.

01:04:03.940 --> 01:04:07.470
You cannot call him your mother, Rimangkasara.

01:04:08.130 --> 01:04:12.350
Let Balak Segambutta take care of you.

01:04:31.980 --> 01:04:38.520
