01:04:41.230 --> 01:04:43.230
There's no place for me to complain anymore.

01:04:43.310 --> 01:04:47.950
I just want to kill myself, that's all.

01:04:48.600 --> 01:04:53.170
Shut up. Don't ask for help, son.

01:04:55.770 --> 01:04:56.910
Wa'am is still young.

01:04:58.310 --> 01:04:59.030
Wa'am's path is still long.

01:05:02.620 --> 01:05:09.270
