Thank you for inviting me to come to your house.

01:07:03.920 --> 01:07:07.240
I've been looking for you for a long time.

01:07:07.860 --> 01:07:16.530
We all know that violence is a serious problem in our lives.

01:07:17.960 --> 01:07:20.800
I've come to ask you to be my companion.

01:07:21.200 --> 01:07:25.180
My name is Aziz.

01:07:25.240 --> 01:07:29.270
I'm the son of Sutan Mantari and I'm very proud to be your companion.

01:07:32.560 --> 01:07:37.010
And from there, the sun rose again from Zainuddin.

01:07:37.850 --> 01:07:39.370
It's the same thing.

01:07:39.370 --> 01:07:42.590
We have to consider the good and the bad.

01:07:42.870 --> 01:07:44.090
We have to think about the good and the bad.

01:07:44.430 --> 01:07:50.460
Our decision is that Aziz is the one we don't want.

01:07:51.980 --> 01:07:56.280
