01:08:21.690 --> 01:08:23.660
Don't look down on me.

01:08:25.260 --> 01:08:29.970
I'm sorry, Hayat.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:32.900
I want to eat the heart of a fallen snake.

01:08:33.060 --> 01:08:37.140
I want to kill myself.

01:08:37.480 --> 01:08:38.520
It's better if you die.

01:08:39.180 --> 01:08:41.160
Instead of being a mother's child,

01:08:41.160 --> 01:08:42.490
