01:10:09.700 --> 01:10:13.660
Be careful.

01:10:14.140 --> 01:10:16.200
Your husband will come back.

01:10:16.300 --> 01:10:17.660
It's the same as before.

01:10:17.920 --> 01:10:21.650
I'm a man.

01:10:22.050 --> 01:10:23.330
I'm going to kill him.

01:10:24.100 --> 01:10:24.940
We're going to eat.

01:10:26.250 --> 01:10:26.710
Don't worry.

01:10:27.130 --> 01:10:28.010
He has a wife.

01:10:31.440 --> 01:10:35.920
So that we can easily attract people from Kito, Jawa, Sukumaya.

01:10:46.020 --> 01:10:48.060
Baanan and elok dan nenek, please come in

