He's a burglar.

01:12:04.930 --> 01:12:09.650
It's your bad luck, Hayati.

01:12:09.850 --> 01:12:14.840
It's a waste of your sacredness if you end up with a dirty man.

01:12:15.830 --> 01:12:17.030
