01:15:05.550 --> 01:15:19.780
Wabilwalidaini ihsana wabizil qurba wabizil qurba waliatama saki jaa

01:15:33.040 --> 01:15:38.160
Zaini, this is not a marriage of wealth and beauty.

01:15:40.710 --> 01:15:44.710
