You hurt your heart too much.

01:46:17.900 --> 01:46:21.060
Your tongue is sharp.

01:46:21.280 --> 01:46:23.530
Your heart is often hurt.

01:46:33.420 --> 01:46:57.370
The heart wants to prepare dinner, the Buddha wants to eat dinner and celebrate the success of the Buddha, the Buddha is given the opportunity to raise the rank to manage the affairs, we will leave

01:47:00.000 --> 01:47:02.240
ducks.

01:47:46.890 --> 01:47:53.400
Before I buy it, I have a question. Why is this house so big? Is it worth it?

01:47:53.760 --> 01:47:59.460
This house was built by a Dutch man...

01:48:00.480 --> 01:48:04.120
because of fraud and other things that violate the law.

01:48:22.280 --> 01:48:26.140
Alright, I will take care of everything.

01:48:26.240 --> 01:48:27.420
Please take care of yourself.

01:48:28.860 --> 01:48:29.800
Alright, thank you very much.

01:48:30.000 --> 01:48:30.540
Let's help you.

01:48:30.956 --> 01:48:31.236
Come on, sir.

01:50:10.680 --> 01:50:14.120
I'm a man of my word.

01:50:14.300 --> 01:50:15.340
I'm a man of my word.

01:50:15.340 --> 01:50:22.420
I'm a man of my word.

01:50:38.160 --> 01:50:43.320
You read a lot of books until you forget about your husband.

01:50:43.400 --> 01:50:47.020
Keep reading!

01:50:47.500 --> 01:50:53.380
Your husband didn't welcome you home.

01:50:53.910 --> 01:50:54.410
Instead, he went to bed.

01:50:54.550 --> 01:50:55.020
Where did you eat?

01:50:56.640 --> 01:50:57.260
I've been waiting for you.

01:51:00.600 --> 01:51:01.920
Maybe you're tired, maybe you're sleepy.

01:51:03.270 --> 01:51:04.670
Don't say that anymore.

01:51:04.670 --> 01:51:07.370
Let me prepare the food.

01:51:07.670 --> 01:51:09.750
You haven't eaten yet.

01:51:09.870 --> 01:51:15.690
What are you doing?

01:51:15.890 --> 01:51:16.480
Are you drunk?

01:51:27.210 --> 01:51:28.510
Don't be like this anymore.

01:51:30.480 --> 01:51:33.150
Our country exists, but our village doesn't.

01:51:33.590 --> 01:51:36.000
Hey, this is a true story.

01:51:36.810 --> 01:51:36.990
It's just a rumor.

01:51:37.510 --> 01:51:39.880
Dad, this is bad news.

01:51:40.340 --> 01:51:42.700
Why? I can't read like this?

01:51:44.210 --> 01:51:44.950
Indado is angry.

01:51:49.040 --> 01:51:49.500
I'm sorry.

01:51:51.920 --> 01:51:53.400
Maybe it's just a rumor.

01:51:54.140 --> 01:51:58.080
I saw this on Latakia's page.

01:51:59.160 --> 01:51:59.700
He's going there.

01:52:00.000 --> 01:52:05.200
His name is Zainuddin. Don't insult Zainuddin too much.

01:52:05.200 --> 01:52:09.010
As far as I know, Zainuddin never insulted me.

01:52:09.510 --> 01:52:12.700
Hey, Zainuddin!

01:52:13.240 --> 01:52:25.470
You still don't accept it? Why?

01:52:32.200 --> 01:52:35.810
She's still in love.

01:52:38.680 --> 01:52:42.650
Why are you still chasing her?

01:52:42.790 --> 01:52:45.400
Why are you still waiting for her?

01:52:46.360 --> 01:52:47.260
Counting the days.

01:52:47.960 --> 01:52:49.540
Every day until she gets home.

01:52:49.700 --> 01:52:52.860
You're tormented by her being like this.

01:52:53.020 --> 01:52:54.080
I'm sorry.

01:53:03.960 --> 01:53:24.660
The city of respect, our new Sumatera club, Tuhan Sabir!

01:53:30.510 --> 01:53:31.250
Salam

01:53:32.220 --> 01:53:32.660
Salam

01:53:32.660 --> 01:53:44.180
At that time, there were still people who called me by the name of Allah

01:53:44.180 --> 01:53:48.060
Let people who want to call me by the name of Allah

01:53:49.520 --> 01:53:51.760
Maybe they only call me by the name of Allah

01:53:51.760 --> 01:53:53.680
The heart of a human being

01:53:53.840 --> 01:53:54.860
Where are we?

01:53:55.660 --> 01:53:57.010
Only Allah

01:53:57.010 --> 01:53:59.980
I know the heart of a human being

01:54:01.500 --> 01:54:03.820
My name is Idang.

01:54:03.960 --> 01:54:06.380
It's a pleasure to talk to you.

01:54:06.400 --> 01:54:07.940
I'm sorry to interrupt.

01:54:08.940 --> 01:54:11.000
But if you're close,

01:54:11.280 --> 01:54:12.280
he's sometimes distant.

01:54:12.880 --> 01:54:14.890
If you're distant, he's close,

01:54:15.130 --> 01:54:16.260
but gentle.

01:54:17.420 --> 01:54:19.360
Why did you have to do that to me?

01:54:19.600 --> 01:54:21.740
You're a woman.

01:56:15.930 --> 01:56:19.160
I've never allowed you to sleep, right?

01:56:19.300 --> 01:56:22.020
I've only asked you to open the door when you're home.

01:56:22.160 --> 01:56:22.380
That's all.

01:56:22.620 --> 01:56:29.360
It's none of your business.

01:56:30.990 --> 01:56:32.830
You're waiting for Udah to look bad, right?

01:56:34.350 --> 01:56:37.340
Forcing his wife not to sleep, waiting for her husband to come home.

01:56:37.400 --> 01:56:37.890
Is that it?

01:56:39.580 --> 01:56:40.340
What else?

01:56:40.520 --> 01:56:52.060
I'm tired, Dad.

01:56:52.220 --> 01:56:52.750
Shut up.

01:56:53.660 --> 01:56:55.610
Where are you taking me to, Dad?

01:56:56.480 --> 01:56:58.280
Don't leave me like this, Dad.

01:56:58.500 --> 01:56:59.970
I'm embarrassed to go home.

01:57:00.060 --> 01:57:01.360
I'll pay you later.

01:57:01.360 --> 01:57:06.970
We don't have money anymore.

01:57:07.130 --> 01:57:08.570
Why do we keep using it for gambling?

01:57:09.350 --> 01:57:11.010
We said we want to start a new life.

01:57:11.370 --> 01:57:20.280
I can't afford to pay for gambling.

01:57:23.250 --> 01:57:24.790
How about you think about how to pay for it?

01:57:45.840 --> 01:57:46.460
Peace be upon you, sir.

01:57:46.820 --> 01:57:47.600
And unto you be peace.

01:57:52.900 --> 01:57:58.280
Your invitation is ready.

01:57:58.580 --> 01:57:59.710
Thank you.

01:58:00.600 --> 01:58:05.900
I assure you that all the children of the Sumatera and Aduk in Surabaya will be present.

01:58:06.040 --> 01:58:08.320
This is a great event, Mr. Xavier.

01:58:09.510 --> 01:58:15.130
After the event is over, as a form of gratitude, I will invite them all to the house.

01:58:16.330 --> 01:58:18.330
Bang Budok, I ask for your help to prepare.

01:58:18.720 --> 01:58:20.930
Okay. Assalamualaikum.

01:58:21.270 --> 01:58:21.710
Assalamualaikum.

01:58:21.750 --> 01:58:22.190
Waalaikumsalam.

01:58:23.220 --> 01:58:23.900
Let's go to the event.

01:58:24.080 --> 01:58:25.000
God willing.

01:58:41.000 --> 01:58:43.930
Tuan Syabir, aka the writer with the name Samaran Zed.

01:58:44.610 --> 01:58:46.810
The opera was led by the writer himself,

01:58:47.600 --> 01:58:49.560
fully supported by the Sumatra Children's Club.

01:58:56.250 --> 01:58:57.390
It's beautiful, isn't it?

01:59:02.620 --> 01:59:13.820
It's not interesting to watch national operas, the play is not as smooth as the Dutch opera.

01:59:13.840 --> 01:59:19.700
Even so, this time bring Adinda.

01:59:21.190 --> 01:59:24.950
Adinda wants to get to know our women who are here.

01:59:42.230 --> 01:59:46.160
We're going to this amazing show.

01:59:47.180 --> 01:59:47.980
Hello!

02:00:03.060 --> 02:00:16.360
Give it to me. Maybe it's cheap for you.

02:00:16.560 --> 02:00:23.090
For me it's very expensive.

02:01:16.000 --> 02:01:20.180
The winner is from LAKON PUKI

02:01:20.450 --> 02:01:29.180
Now we will introduce the winner

02:01:30.000 --> 02:01:32.570
The one who will get the record is...

02:01:33.200 --> 02:01:35.800
Mr. Sabir!

02:02:04.540 --> 02:02:04.900
Thank you.

02:04:02.270 --> 02:04:04.000
Everything is the same

02:04:04.000 --> 02:04:25.490
Tuan Aziz and Rengkayo Hayati

02:04:25.490 --> 02:04:28.260
You guys have been here for a long time, in Surabaya?

02:04:28.360 --> 02:04:29.280
Just 3 months

02:04:31.470 --> 02:04:34.860
We've been in Surabaya for a long time, and now we meet again.

02:04:35.660 --> 02:04:44.580
We didn't expect a famous poet to be so popular.

02:04:45.080 --> 02:04:48.320
His writings mean that he's our friend.

02:04:49.400 --> 02:04:50.380
Tuan Zain...

02:04:50.380 --> 02:04:53.910
Syabir, you don't have a name anymore.

02:04:53.970 --> 02:04:56.220
You don't fit in with me.

02:04:56.480 --> 02:04:59.230
Your name is Syabir. Isn't it better?

02:05:00.410 --> 02:05:03.010
All the names are suitable for the person.

02:05:06.220 --> 02:05:12.650
Ladies and gentlemen, let me introduce you to my friends, Aziz and his wife,

02:05:13.830 --> 02:05:17.490
Tengkai Ayahati from Padang Panjang.

02:05:19.360 --> 02:05:20.660
Maybe you remember, this is Bang Muda.

02:05:20.980 --> 02:05:28.520
Excuse me, excuse me.

02:05:28.720 --> 02:05:29.260
You're welcome.

02:05:35.210 --> 02:05:42.070
We don't need to be surprised. We have to admit our greatness.

02:05:43.640 --> 02:05:44.820
Syabir is a big man.

02:05:44.920 --> 02:05:52.020
I mean, people will respect us if we are friends with him.

02:05:52.260 --> 02:05:56.400
I don't want to talk anymore. Who knows he might want to change.

02:05:57.300 --> 02:05:58.060
Don't talk anymore.

02:06:58.350 --> 02:06:58.570
Thank you for watching.

02:07:00.440 --> 02:07:01.320
And he lent money to us.

02:07:01.500 --> 02:07:07.360
The debt of so many people will be over soon.

02:07:07.540 --> 02:07:10.250
There will be some left.

02:07:10.510 --> 02:07:16.930
Do you remember what we did to him?

02:07:16.970 --> 02:07:20.550
Now he is so nice to us.

02:07:20.790 --> 02:07:29.180
Are you ashamed to lend money to him?

02:07:32.680 --> 02:07:33.140
What are you doing?

02:07:34.870 --> 02:07:36.150
You're talking too much

02:08:04.380 --> 02:08:07.320
I'm leaving tonight. You don't have to wait for me to come home.

02:08:07.360 --> 02:08:11.190
Where do you want to go?

02:08:11.490 --> 02:08:14.910
You just borrowed money from Dusta.

02:08:15.030 --> 02:08:17.800
You want to get married again?

02:08:17.940 --> 02:08:22.020
Where is your respect as a man?

02:08:22.320 --> 02:08:24.820
Where is your respect as a human?

02:08:26.330 --> 02:08:27.570
You're a stupid woman.

02:08:27.590 --> 02:08:29.760
From you.

02:08:31.460 --> 02:08:35.720
Don't be happy anymore. I'm going to make more money tonight.

02:08:35.760 --> 02:08:48.040
I don't have any shame, Aziz.

02:08:48.200 --> 02:08:50.380
Are you sure it's hard to make money because of Judi?

02:08:50.860 --> 02:08:52.860
It's not good to think like that, Bang Bulu.

02:08:54.000 --> 02:08:57.720
Now we're friends with them. The Silaturahim Tali has already happened.

02:08:58.270 --> 02:08:59.590
But Ngku, they used to...

02:09:00.120 --> 02:09:07.210
It's okay, it's already in the past, so it's not a matter of the past. I'm just helping people who are in trouble.

02:09:09.470 --> 02:09:12.740
I'm done Aziz, I'm sorry. Please forgive him.

02:09:18.400 --> 02:09:22.430
Don't worry, my friend. Ida and you have started sending letters.

02:09:23.950 --> 02:09:27.440
That's good, Bang Mulo. I'm glad to hear that you have a match in Rantau.

02:09:30.760 --> 02:09:31.780
What about you, Mr. Hayati?

02:09:32.020 --> 02:09:36.020
If there's a new relationship between me and Aziz,

02:09:36.040 --> 02:09:38.880
then there's also a new relationship between me and Mr. Hayati.

02:09:38.980 --> 02:09:44.000
My friendship with Aziz and his wife

02:09:44.000 --> 02:09:48.230
is just like my friendship with other members of the Sumatra Club.

02:09:48.490 --> 02:09:54.440
Actually, what's your relationship with Mr. Hayati?

02:09:54.540 --> 02:09:55.890
Why are you throwing a party?

02:09:56.630 --> 02:09:59.460
I know you don't like those kinds of events.

02:10:01.820 --> 02:10:04.570
I know from the Sumatra Club that Cihayati is in Surabaya.

02:10:04.650 --> 02:10:07.160
I still miss her.

02:10:15.070 --> 02:10:15.910
Bang Muluk once said,

02:10:16.130 --> 02:10:19.210
a person who loses in love,

02:10:19.450 --> 02:10:23.110
takes another path until he goes up to a high peak.

02:10:23.210 --> 02:10:27.000
So that woman can see him with a glance from below.

02:10:47.400 --> 02:10:48.200
Why do you eat this kind of food?

02:10:52.440 --> 02:10:54.420
I don't want to eat village food like this.

02:10:54.500 --> 02:10:57.660
I'm out of money.

02:11:00.280 --> 02:11:01.960
He never gave money back to Ati.

02:11:03.290 --> 02:11:14.400
Pay your debt.

02:11:14.660 --> 02:11:16.880
I already paid.

02:11:17.610 --> 02:11:18.790
Why do you want to pay me?

02:11:19.590 --> 02:11:21.770
My debt is too high.

02:11:21.890 --> 02:11:23.120
You're losing your temper.

02:11:23.500 --> 02:11:24.260
What's wrong, sir?

02:11:24.500 --> 02:11:25.820
You want me to beat you?

02:11:26.620 --> 02:11:27.660
I'll beat your ass.

02:11:27.900 --> 02:11:29.960
I'll beat your ass.

02:11:30.000 --> 02:11:31.080
All of your jewelry is gone.

02:11:31.620 --> 02:11:33.930
I'll take care of it.

02:11:35.400 --> 02:11:37.300
You're a victim. You're a devil.

02:11:37.660 --> 02:11:42.800
I don't want to pay you.

02:11:42.820 --> 02:11:43.680
All of your stuff is gone.

02:11:44.060 --> 02:11:45.260
Calm down, sir.

02:11:45.380 --> 02:11:46.910
So that my husband can calm down.

02:11:49.760 --> 02:11:50.020
How?

02:11:50.400 --> 02:11:52.520
Take it to the office first.

02:11:53.060 --> 02:11:54.160
Office? What office?

02:11:56.140 --> 02:11:58.000
I've been at the office for a week.

02:11:58.100 --> 02:11:59.480
It's broken.

02:12:02.680 --> 02:12:04.090
Hey, what about some coffee?

02:12:05.350 --> 02:12:07.860
Coffee! Coffee!

02:12:08.160 --> 02:12:08.700
Wait!

02:12:09.280 --> 02:12:10.780
You have to bring the coffee!

02:12:11.060 --> 02:12:13.220
You don't have coffee!

02:12:13.220 --> 02:12:13.600
You don't have coffee!

02:12:13.600 --> 02:12:14.800
What about the coffee?

02:12:15.260 --> 02:12:16.660
Where's the coffee?

02:12:30.000 --> 02:12:30.660
And just shut up!

02:12:31.060 --> 02:12:33.620
We don't have any money anymore

02:12:33.620 --> 02:12:36.180
And now we don't have any stuff

02:12:36.180 --> 02:12:38.930
How is our life now?

02:12:39.250 --> 02:12:42.880
Just answer me

02:12:43.900 --> 02:12:46.240
What are we going to do now?

02:13:02.620 --> 02:13:06.260
Don't be sad. Please consider this as your own house.

02:13:06.280 --> 02:13:12.460
Thank you, sir. I can't imagine how it would be without you, sir.

02:13:12.800 --> 02:13:17.220
You're welcome. You should be helping each other out.

02:13:18.410 --> 02:13:22.680
Later, Bang Uluq will show you all of this house.

02:13:22.920 --> 02:13:29.900
You too, except for me. I'm asking for your help.

02:13:30.830 --> 02:13:33.750
This is my workroom. I hope you don't go in there.

02:13:33.750 --> 02:13:37.820
I'll show you the room later.

02:13:37.820 --> 02:13:43.120
Thank you.

02:13:43.260 --> 02:13:47.320
Come on.

02:14:13.600 --> 02:14:19.140
That's it. Eat it. It's nutritious.

02:14:19.500 --> 02:14:24.050
Your mind will be clear. Eat it.

02:14:31.440 --> 02:14:52.550
My brothers and sisters

02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:03.030
My brother and my wife, please allow me to accompany you here.

02:15:04.480 --> 02:15:05.500
I am Daif Benar now.

02:15:05.820 --> 02:15:23.060
There is no feeling from me to ask God for your service to be painted on his side.

02:15:25.400 --> 02:15:26.400
That's not a service.

02:15:30.000 --> 02:15:40.880
It is the duty of a friend to his friend, especially our lives are in conflict, it is obligatory to defend one another.

02:15:41.730 --> 02:15:48.960
I have never given to my brothers, I just always accept.

02:15:49.300 --> 02:15:58.300
Because there is no time, now it's me who can do it, maybe later I will be helped.

02:15:59.390 --> 02:15:59.630
Always.

02:16:00.120 --> 02:16:00.560
Good, brother.

02:16:00.820 --> 02:16:03.100
Only God is good.

02:16:03.100 --> 02:16:10.960
Listen, brother.

02:16:15.330 --> 02:16:20.780
I will leave immediately from today.

02:16:24.380 --> 02:16:26.360
I will look for another job in another city.

02:16:31.150 --> 02:16:32.670
I'm ashamed to accompany you to your house.

02:16:33.990 --> 02:16:35.070
I'm ashamed to be in Surabaya.

02:16:38.790 --> 02:16:39.690
You're not important.

02:16:43.250 --> 02:16:47.650
Please let me live here until I get you.

02:16:47.690 --> 02:16:53.670
Please let me inform you that when I get you,

02:16:53.770 --> 02:16:58.210
I can take care of you.

02:17:11.450 --> 02:17:21.230
I don't care that Uda's wife is gone, but I doubt that if Uda's health is not back to normal,

02:17:21.390 --> 02:17:26.140
it's because he's shy and wants to leave.

02:17:28.700 --> 02:17:29.840
It's better to hold on, Udo.

02:17:31.280 --> 02:17:32.400
Until the body is really strong

02:17:32.400 --> 02:17:34.050
I'm much better

02:17:34.050 --> 02:17:50.020
How about you Aziz and Hayati go back to Padang

02:17:50.020 --> 02:17:55.680
I think it's better to go back to Nahu

02:17:55.680 --> 02:17:59.870
You will make me back

02:18:00.000 --> 02:18:04.600
Go back to think and keep your heart

02:18:04.600 --> 02:18:08.980
Even though it will fall apart again

02:18:09.100 --> 02:18:13.320
No, that can't be

02:18:15.450 --> 02:18:16.190
Embarrassing

02:18:37.960 --> 02:18:38.900
What do you think, Hayati?

02:18:49.260 --> 02:18:50.520
I just think...

02:18:50.520 --> 02:18:58.610
Alright, if that's the case, the decision has been taken by Aziz.

02:19:01.560 --> 02:19:27.560
Go, wherever you go, send us letters, give us news, if you get a job, you can pick up your father or I will take you, but my advice is only one.

02:19:31.370 --> 02:19:32.550
Change the course of life.

02:19:32.630 --> 02:19:38.320
I promise.

02:20:12.600 --> 02:20:15.510
I have a job to do

02:20:33.548 --> 02:20:35.548
I

02:21:04.000 --> 02:21:04.200
I'm sorry.

02:21:38.860 --> 02:21:54.880
Thank you very much.

02:22:14.560 --> 02:22:17.500
Ngkuh, I have to try this.

02:22:17.580 --> 02:22:19.440
Mr. Hayati makes dendeng.

02:22:19.480 --> 02:22:20.830
It's delicious.

02:22:22.980 --> 02:22:25.150
Are you done eating?

02:22:25.430 --> 02:22:25.730
Yes.

02:22:43.880 --> 02:22:44.710
Thank you

02:22:44.710 --> 02:22:59.460
I'm sorry

02:23:00.540 --> 02:23:03.910
Ati thought I would eat it, so she could heat up the pot.

02:23:04.390 --> 02:23:11.230
It's almost done.

02:23:11.790 --> 02:23:17.810
Oh right, tomorrow Bang Muluk will ask Ati to make rendang.

02:23:19.480 --> 02:23:26.620
I like it. Good night.

02:24:04.410 --> 02:24:08.350
I'm going home, I'm sorry, there's no one in this room

02:24:08.350 --> 02:24:14.170
I made tea, it's not comfortable not to make someone who has a house

02:24:14.170 --> 02:24:18.200
I thought Zainuddin was inside

02:24:40.720 --> 02:24:48.620
Bang Bulu, since I've been here, he's been acting like a coward.

02:24:49.220 --> 02:24:53.700
Is there anything I can do to help him?

02:24:54.080 --> 02:24:58.450
No, don't take it the wrong way, Anjo.

02:24:59.200 --> 02:24:59.980
And why did you...

02:25:00.000 --> 02:25:01.400
No one is allowed to enter his office.

02:25:02.550 --> 02:25:09.750
It's been a long time since I last had a heart attack.

02:25:10.750 --> 02:25:16.470
I need to make sure.

02:25:16.710 --> 02:25:19.840
Has he still blamed me?

02:25:20.580 --> 02:25:24.070
Has he still not apologized to me?

02:25:24.330 --> 02:25:28.830
Miss, Zainuddin is an unfortunate young man.

02:25:32.750 --> 02:25:36.110
Is it not that fame, glory, and glory are all the same?

02:25:40.550 --> 02:25:44.300
Now he's famous, but that's just his appearance.

02:25:44.720 --> 02:25:48.950
In his heart, he's still an unlucky person.

02:25:48.950 --> 02:25:50.480
His heart is broken.

02:25:50.480 --> 02:25:52.650
What do you mean?

02:25:52.960 --> 02:25:53.760
What do you mean?

02:25:54.020 --> 02:25:58.070
He has been broken since he was born.

02:25:58.590 --> 02:25:59.830
What the f**k?

02:26:00.000 --> 02:26:01.860
who was accepted by Nyo since his father, Bundo Nyo.

02:26:01.860 --> 02:26:04.280
He was exiled from his native land.

02:26:04.560 --> 02:26:09.390
But Nyo's heart is still firm

02:26:09.390 --> 02:26:11.900
because there is a woman who has given him advice

02:26:11.900 --> 02:26:14.930
and promised to wait for him.

02:26:17.060 --> 02:26:19.640
But then the woman is more attracted to other men

02:26:19.640 --> 02:26:21.090
who are more arrogant,

02:26:21.410 --> 02:26:21.770
rich,

02:26:23.310 --> 02:26:23.790
civilized,

02:26:23.810 --> 02:26:27.020
and from Tulen, Minangkabau.

02:26:27.430 --> 02:26:28.190
Enough, Bang.

02:26:34.960 --> 02:26:38.130
now he is a very loving person

02:26:38.130 --> 02:26:42.310
I feel sorry for him

02:26:43.030 --> 02:26:47.200
he came to me and said that he is in need of money to get married

02:26:47.200 --> 02:26:49.220
I asked him for help

02:26:49.220 --> 02:26:53.380
he said that he will give enough money to them for their marriage

02:26:53.380 --> 02:26:57.660
I asked him, I feel the same as him

02:26:57.660 --> 02:26:58.560
how does it affect me?

02:27:00.000 --> 02:27:03.340
The hope is gone, the love that hasn't arrived.

02:27:03.520 --> 02:27:06.840
Let the young child not suffer what I have suffered.

02:27:07.930 --> 02:27:08.450
Not enough.

02:27:10.530 --> 02:27:11.370
No need to continue.

02:27:11.990 --> 02:27:21.860
Come on, Cik.

02:27:21.860 --> 02:27:22.990
Follow Walin.

02:27:33.130 --> 02:27:33.510
Let's go, Miss.

02:27:33.570 --> 02:27:43.300
This is where Uncle Zainuddin got his fortune.

02:27:43.500 --> 02:27:48.410
And this is where the source of his fame came from.

02:27:48.410 --> 02:27:49.310
In the midst of our nation's poverty.

02:27:50.370 --> 02:27:56.970
The room is so beautiful.

02:27:57.350 --> 02:27:59.960
Why am I forbidden to...

02:28:00.000 --> 02:28:04.740
This is the reason

02:28:45.320 --> 02:28:55.170
As long as I will never forget that the love I have for you is now gone.

02:28:55.310 --> 02:28:59.330
No, I still have it.

02:29:00.440 --> 02:29:03.420
Here he is. He's still alive.

02:29:03.980 --> 02:29:08.390
The life that he loved is gone now.

02:29:08.390 --> 02:29:09.460
He's dead.

02:29:11.020 --> 02:29:12.720
Zainuddin's spirit is taking him to his grave.

02:29:13.140 --> 02:29:17.070
The life that he's carrying in his house now is his friend.

02:29:17.350 --> 02:29:21.960
And his friend's wife is a woman.

02:29:22.360 --> 02:29:25.390
I, Zainuddin, respect you as someone else's wife.

02:30:03.770 --> 02:30:05.990
Showing the hope of the brothers and sisters who are starting to walk in the right direction.

02:30:06.010 --> 02:30:09.560
I am happy. I respect Hayati.

02:30:09.600 --> 02:30:15.920
I influenced his family with money, with descendants.

02:30:16.200 --> 02:30:20.340
Our marriage is only a beautiful marriage.

02:30:23.980 --> 02:30:27.820
Therefore, with this letter, I return Hayati to my hands.

02:30:30.000 --> 02:30:32.540
I will not let you go in my bond.

02:30:33.020 --> 02:30:39.990
I feel that this is only a little revenge to you and Hayati.

02:30:40.550 --> 02:30:47.560
From me who loves you, you are more entitled to Hayati.

02:30:49.000 --> 02:30:51.980
And Hayati will be happy to have a husband who fits her soul.

02:31:00.220 --> 02:31:01.340
I'm disappointed in you.

02:31:04.180 --> 02:31:05.240
You're often punished.

02:31:05.520 --> 02:31:09.680
Please forgive me.

02:31:15.000 --> 02:31:15.060
Okay.

02:31:16.080 --> 02:31:16.800
I'm sorry.

02:31:17.040 --> 02:31:25.480
I will erase this sadness.

02:31:25.800 --> 02:31:28.510
Give me back your sweet smile.

02:31:33.480 --> 02:31:38.030
Then I took you first with a marriage that was in accordance with religion.

02:31:38.170 --> 02:31:42.560
Now I let you go with a marriage that was in accordance with religion.

02:31:42.620 --> 02:31:47.100
Until this letter comes to your hand,

02:31:49.000 --> 02:31:50.840
fall my talaq to you once.

02:31:51.160 --> 02:31:57.910
And if you don't get there, don't come back to me.

02:31:57.990 --> 02:31:59.830
But just stay.

02:32:00.250 --> 02:32:10.440
If he still likes to accept you as his wife, I have disappointed the life journey of a poor man.

02:32:12.200 --> 02:32:21.930
Breaking one's hope, I will give punishment to myself, your ex-husband.

02:33:30.170 --> 02:33:30.290
Thank you.

02:34:07.230 --> 02:34:07.490
Sit down

02:34:27.670 --> 02:34:29.530
It's been a month since I stopped

02:34:30.160 --> 02:34:45.850
My love has gone. What is the meaning of my love?

02:34:46.290 --> 02:34:53.830
Yes, what is the meaning of our love?

02:34:54.190 --> 02:34:59.500
I will keep my word to you.

02:35:00.000 --> 02:35:05.690
I will be honest with you.

02:35:05.730 --> 02:35:13.040
I will call your name again,

02:35:14.870 --> 02:35:17.450
as I have called it before.

02:35:20.580 --> 02:35:25.990
Zainuddin, I am willing to endure

02:35:25.990 --> 02:35:27.910
any trial that comes my way.

02:35:31.790 --> 02:35:34.250
As long as you're willing to forgive me for what I've done

02:35:34.910 --> 02:35:50.020
I'm sorry, you're so stubborn in telling me what to do

02:35:50.020 --> 02:35:53.380
You broke up with me, you're apologizing

02:36:00.090 --> 02:36:02.370
Why did you answer me so cruelly, Zainuddin?

02:36:02.430 --> 02:36:07.280
Have you lost your peace of mind?

02:36:07.940 --> 02:36:13.640
I hope you will not be punished.

02:36:14.260 --> 02:36:18.360
Have mercy on the woman who was put in such a bad situation.

02:36:21.020 --> 02:36:24.490
Yes, that's right, woman.

02:36:24.810 --> 02:36:29.750
She only remembers how cruel people are to her, even though she's young.

02:36:31.240 --> 02:36:35.300
And he forgot his own weakness in others, even though he was so great.

02:36:35.640 --> 02:36:38.940
Have you forgotten who is among us who is weak?

02:36:40.300 --> 02:36:44.320
Are you not the one who promised when I was expelled by your mother and father?

02:36:44.480 --> 02:36:46.420
Because I was not certain.

02:36:46.640 --> 02:36:49.160
The people of Hina-Dina are not stupid Minangkabau.

02:36:49.300 --> 02:36:53.380
If that's the case, take me to Simpangja.

02:36:53.580 --> 02:36:58.100
You promise to wait for my arrival no matter how long it takes.

02:36:59.370 --> 02:36:59.930
Topic

02:37:00.000 --> 02:37:01.240
The choice you chose was the worst.

02:37:01.860 --> 02:37:05.340
Rich, rich, with a nation, with a culture, with an institution, with a descendant.

02:37:05.420 --> 02:37:06.640
You married him.

02:37:07.020 --> 02:37:10.900
You said to me that marriage is not someone else's obligation.

02:37:10.920 --> 02:37:11.920
But it's your own choice.

02:37:12.880 --> 02:37:17.190
I almost died fighting for my love.

02:37:17.690 --> 02:37:20.840
For two months, I was lying in bed.

02:37:21.200 --> 02:37:23.340
You strangled me in my illness.

02:37:23.980 --> 02:37:25.600
Showing that your hand has changed.

02:37:26.020 --> 02:37:28.230
That you have become someone else's possession.

02:37:30.060 --> 02:37:31.560
Who among us has mercy?

02:37:31.940 --> 02:37:37.640
I sent letters, cursing, humiliating myself, begging to be pitied.

02:37:38.340 --> 02:37:42.980
Suddenly, you just replied to that letter with an insult that was all over the place.

02:37:43.080 --> 02:37:44.480
Not eaten by a chicken.

02:37:44.680 --> 02:37:47.540
You said that you were poor, I was poor too.

02:37:47.940 --> 02:37:50.060
Life wouldn't be lucky if it wasn't for money.

02:37:50.220 --> 02:37:53.390
Because of that, you chose a life that was easier.

02:37:53.880 --> 02:37:57.640
Swimming, enough money, swimming in gold, flying, throwing paper.

02:37:58.280 --> 02:37:58.900
I'm sorry.

02:38:00.030 --> 02:38:01.790
Who among us is cruel, Hayati?

02:38:01.890 --> 02:38:06.550
Who has prevented a young man with high ambitions to become a laughing stock?

02:38:06.700 --> 02:38:09.040
But in the end, he was thrown far away to the land of Java.

02:38:09.300 --> 02:38:11.300
He lost his village and his land.

02:38:11.640 --> 02:38:15.150
So he became a laughing stock in the face of the world.

02:38:15.250 --> 02:38:17.200
But he cried behind the scenes.

02:38:17.300 --> 02:38:20.080
No, Hayati. I'm not cruel.

02:38:21.100 --> 02:38:22.840
I only obey your words.

02:38:23.820 --> 02:38:25.680
Isn't it you who asked in your letter?

02:38:25.860 --> 02:38:28.200
So that our love is lost and forgotten.

02:38:29.380 --> 02:38:29.900
Replaced.

02:38:30.000 --> 02:38:35.130
But with the lost friendship, that's the request that I hold firmly now.

02:38:35.780 --> 02:38:41.980
You are not my love, not my engagement, not my wife, but a slave of someone else.

02:38:43.460 --> 02:38:51.080
Therefore, as a friend, even as a brother, I will firmly hold my promise again in that friendship.

02:38:51.950 --> 02:38:55.830
As I firmly promised to hold my love.

02:39:02.330 --> 02:39:09.800
That's why, with all my heart, I brought you to my house to wait for your husband's arrival.

02:39:10.050 --> 02:39:15.510
But then, not only did he return home, but the news of the divorce was terrible.

02:39:16.990 --> 02:39:23.020
Therefore, as your friend, I will let you go back to your village, to your homeland.

02:39:23.680 --> 02:39:29.870
The land of Minangkabau, which is rich, which is well-established, which is unyielding in the rain.

02:39:30.830 --> 02:39:34.290
I will give you your dowry.

02:39:35.780 --> 02:39:37.280
That's all the money you need.

02:39:37.660 --> 02:39:40.700
And if I'm still alive,

02:39:41.930 --> 02:39:43.590
before you get a husband again,

02:39:43.730 --> 02:39:47.900
God willing, I will help you live in the village forever.

02:40:01.760 --> 02:40:08.160
Zainuddin, it's not the decision you made for me.

02:40:08.200 --> 02:40:13.860
You're not the most famous person in the world.

02:40:14.140 --> 02:40:16.610
You're a noble person.

02:40:16.610 --> 02:40:21.600
No, I won't go home.

02:40:21.780 --> 02:40:24.810
I will stay here with you.

02:40:24.910 --> 02:40:26.670
Let me humiliate you.

02:40:26.790 --> 02:40:29.210
Let me see you as a humiliating woman.

02:40:29.270 --> 02:40:29.910
I...

02:40:30.000 --> 02:40:34.000
No matter how much money I need, I need you, Zainuddin.

02:40:34.140 --> 02:40:46.180
I need you.

02:41:00.160 --> 02:41:00.980
Two times the price of a banana

02:41:00.980 --> 02:41:03.890
Two times the price of the rest of the food

02:41:03.890 --> 02:41:11.560
I must go back to you

02:41:11.560 --> 02:41:14.930
Leave me in this state

02:41:16.300 --> 02:41:17.960
Don't you dare to trample my life

02:41:19.220 --> 02:41:19.860
Uncertain people

02:41:21.940 --> 02:41:22.420
Minangkabau

02:41:22.420 --> 02:41:24.100
Is there

02:41:24.100 --> 02:41:27.110
Tomorrow Monday

02:41:27.110 --> 02:41:29.720
There is a ship departing from Surabaya to

02:41:30.000 --> 02:41:33.800
Tanjung Priok will go straight to Van Der Wijk's ship.

02:41:34.810 --> 02:41:37.330
You go with that ship back to your village.

02:41:44.040 --> 02:41:51.650
To go back to your village, Bang Bulok will take care of everything.

02:41:51.990 --> 02:41:56.970
I can't take her. I have to go to Malang.

02:41:57.010 --> 02:41:58.110
I have to stay there. There's an order.

02:42:01.950 --> 02:42:07.740
If you have reached the village, send my regards to the horse.

02:44:02.300 --> 02:44:04.260
My heart will refuse to see this ship.

02:44:04.700 --> 02:44:07.990
My legs will be bent on the ground.

02:44:09.620 --> 02:44:17.370
I will not be a person who will ever go into the sea of ​​feelings.

02:44:17.410 --> 02:44:21.230
And it will not happen again.

02:44:22.990 --> 02:44:23.930
I'm happy, Cik.

02:44:24.070 --> 02:44:25.760
That's just how I feel, Cik.

02:44:26.240 --> 02:44:29.740
Come on, Cik.

02:44:31.660 --> 02:44:31.820
You

02:45:00.640 --> 02:45:00.820
Thank you.

02:46:30.000 --> 02:46:31.210
I really miss you

02:46:31.490 --> 02:46:33.470
I'm sorry for putting that picture in your pocket

02:46:33.470 --> 02:46:35.580
I didn't put it in the cupboard

02:46:35.580 --> 02:46:38.200
So that it's easier if you want to see it

02:46:38.200 --> 02:46:42.980
So that Zainudin can accompany me on my journey

02:46:42.980 --> 02:46:44.480
I'm sorry

02:46:44.480 --> 02:46:46.950
I didn't let your heart go to waste

02:46:46.950 --> 02:46:48.470
I'm sorry

02:46:48.470 --> 02:46:51.340
I'm begging you

02:46:51.340 --> 02:46:57.290
Until Zainudin's true heart comes back

02:46:57.290 --> 02:46:59.680
Please make my heart strong

02:47:00.570 --> 02:47:02.930
Don't forget God, Insya Allah.

02:47:03.150 --> 02:47:05.060
We will always be in your care.

02:47:05.520 --> 02:47:07.300
Insya Allah, Bang Muluk.

02:47:07.340 --> 02:47:12.330
Good luck on your journey, Cik. Good luck on your journey home.

02:47:12.590 --> 02:47:21.070
Bang Muluk, please deliver this letter to my brother Zainudi.

02:47:21.290 --> 02:47:23.880
Don't go back to him.

02:47:24.690 --> 02:47:26.610
Until the time we are separated,

02:47:26.990 --> 02:47:29.530
your life will still remind him.

02:47:33.480 --> 02:47:34.000
Alright, sir.

02:48:30.830 --> 02:48:34.210
That my heart has been fighting so hard since Hayati was released.

02:48:34.590 --> 02:48:37.490
I regret letting him go.

02:48:37.650 --> 02:48:42.240
My love for Hayati is not gone yet.

02:48:42.260 --> 02:48:44.680
Ngkuh, you don't understand my war.

02:48:44.820 --> 02:48:47.700
All this time, Ngkuh has been fighting to remember Hayati.

02:48:47.940 --> 02:48:51.510
Now, after being thrown an opportunity of meeting between me and him,

02:48:51.550 --> 02:48:53.340
I punish him with one sentence.

02:48:53.660 --> 02:48:54.820
Which you are also surprised.

02:48:54.960 --> 02:48:57.780
The sentence came out from the mouth of a noble man and a Buddhist like Ngkuh.

02:48:57.820 --> 02:48:59.910
I'm angry if you say that sometimes the war is important.

02:49:00.700 --> 02:49:06.250
Yes, brother. I was wrong. My heart and heart preceded the prayer.

02:49:06.850 --> 02:49:13.220
When I left, Ms. Hayati sent a letter.

02:49:13.360 --> 02:49:18.820
Ms. Hayati said, until the time we parted, she still remembered me.

02:49:19.140 --> 02:49:29.530
The dependence of my soul on her is indeed very great.

02:49:30.000 --> 02:49:33.740
I hope I can live closer to you

02:49:35.140 --> 02:49:40.300
so that the dream that you have attached for so long can come true

02:49:40.300 --> 02:49:48.100
so that I can get all the big mistakes that I have committed to you

02:49:49.320 --> 02:49:50.520
I wait for you

02:49:52.750 --> 02:49:58.560
but my dreams will always remain dreams

02:50:00.000 --> 02:50:03.940
Because you're the one who closed the door in front of me

02:50:04.000 --> 02:50:06.080
I'm sorry

02:50:06.330 --> 02:50:19.070
Because you want to erase all the pain that has been in my heart for so long

02:50:19.070 --> 02:50:20.890
Instead of replying to that revenge

02:50:20.890 --> 02:50:24.910
You took a decision that was so cruel

02:50:24.910 --> 02:50:28.190
You tied the rope of my hope

02:50:30.280 --> 02:50:35.640
On the other hand, on that rope, your own hope changes.

02:50:37.840 --> 02:50:45.130
Therefore, believe me, Zainuddin, that this punishment is not about myself alone.

02:50:45.470 --> 02:50:48.940
It's not that he caused an accident to me.

02:50:49.220 --> 02:50:52.490
But to both of us.

02:50:52.590 --> 02:50:58.600
Because I know that you still love me.

02:51:00.830 --> 02:51:07.950
Zainuddin, if I'm not here, your life won't change either.

02:51:07.950 --> 02:51:17.920
Believe me, in my soul there is a great wealth that you really need.

02:51:18.140 --> 02:51:26.820
And that wealth has never been given to a noble person.

02:51:26.880 --> 02:51:29.340
That wealth is...

02:51:30.380 --> 02:51:39.730
If you accept my return, I will not ask for a reward.

02:51:40.210 --> 02:51:50.840
The reward that I expect from holy love is only from Allah so that you will be given happiness.

02:51:53.100 --> 02:51:59.070
The second reward that I expect is that I can always live.

02:52:06.040 --> 02:52:14.920
Zaini, you will be a woman who is still holy in her heart, holy in her soul.

02:52:14.940 --> 02:52:17.770
She has never been touched by others.

02:52:18.170 --> 02:52:20.830
Her heart has never been stolen.

02:52:23.060 --> 02:52:29.980
There is no difference between a man and a woman.

02:52:30.000 --> 02:52:33.880
The girl you loved two and three years ago

02:52:33.880 --> 02:52:37.510
whose picture was hanging in the writing room

02:52:37.510 --> 02:52:43.850
But that's really your answer

02:52:44.150 --> 02:52:46.880
Your mistake was done

02:52:47.820 --> 02:52:49.900
because of Lantaran

02:52:49.900 --> 02:52:52.240
I will love you

02:52:52.240 --> 02:52:58.250
and you do everything

02:52:58.250 --> 02:52:59.250
Lantaran

02:53:00.030 --> 02:53:00.610
I love you

02:53:35.600 --> 02:53:56.580
The second thing I want to tell you is that you have to come back to me if you have never come back to me.

02:54:00.350 --> 02:54:03.150
There is only one hope that has been lost.

02:54:05.180 --> 02:54:06.540
Let your heart be at peace.

02:54:08.260 --> 02:54:11.780
Let us both get rid of the disappointment that is already there.

02:54:14.020 --> 02:54:15.080
Forgive me.

02:54:17.280 --> 02:54:18.760
Love me again.

02:54:22.140 --> 02:54:22.580
Zainuddin

02:54:22.580 --> 02:54:26.340
The one who is baptized in prayer.

02:54:26.600 --> 02:54:29.780
And I will face God in the end.

02:54:32.650 --> 02:54:43.890
If I die earlier than you, don't be sad, but perfect the prayer to God.

02:54:44.150 --> 02:54:53.770
Long live Zainudi, long live my beloved people in this world.

02:54:55.850 --> 02:54:56.830
Love will marry you.

02:55:00.250 --> 02:55:06.010
May you rest in peace, Zainuddin.

02:55:06.110 --> 02:55:19.060
I love you and will always remember you.

02:55:20.900 --> 02:55:21.220
Bang Mulu!

02:55:24.460 --> 02:55:25.600
Let's go to the train station.

02:55:25.680 --> 02:55:26.660
Find a ticket for tonight.

02:55:27.900 --> 02:55:29.800
Buy two tickets and go back to Surabaya.

02:55:30.190 --> 02:55:31.170
I will take care of Hayati.

02:55:31.370 --> 02:55:31.990
Come on, Ngkuh.

02:55:32.170 --> 02:55:34.570
Please stop all my and Mr. Hayati's activities.

02:55:34.630 --> 02:55:37.000
And let God's grace cover me and Hayati.

02:55:37.080 --> 02:55:42.350
Ngkuh! Come on, Ngkuh!

02:57:00.000 --> 02:57:02.250
I hate Hayati.

02:57:18.050 --> 02:57:22.840
Hayati, how is he?

02:57:23.220 --> 02:57:26.990
His condition is bad. His lungs are full of water.

02:57:27.470 --> 02:57:28.230
And his bones are damaged.

02:57:30.000 --> 02:57:34.110
I have to use my own blood to help her.

02:57:34.170 --> 02:57:37.440
Dear, our equipment is not suitable.

02:57:38.050 --> 02:57:39.510
We are sending her to Surabaya.

02:57:39.590 --> 02:57:42.140
And some doctors are coming to help her.

02:57:42.830 --> 02:57:50.120
Please be careful.

02:57:53.320 --> 02:57:53.620
Okay.

02:58:06.880 --> 02:58:07.380
Zainuddin

02:58:10.500 --> 02:58:11.020
Hayati

02:58:11.020 --> 02:58:13.980
It seems that Allah does not allow us to part

02:58:14.040 --> 02:58:17.060
This is Zainuddin

02:58:17.060 --> 02:58:17.340
Dear

02:58:18.320 --> 02:58:20.210
You will be healed

02:58:20.210 --> 02:58:21.820
We will go home

02:58:21.820 --> 02:58:24.480
We will go home to our house in Surabaya

02:58:32.590 --> 02:58:33.970
I want to go home

02:58:42.380 --> 02:58:53.710
I want to go home

02:59:05.120 --> 02:59:27.640
Who is it, who is it, who is it

02:59:27.640 --> 02:59:29.540
Oh, the dog is looking at you

02:59:30.030 --> 02:59:37.930
Enough, don't talk anymore. We're going back to Surabaya. We're going to get married. We're going to live together.

02:59:38.600 --> 02:59:40.220
Happiness and love are in front of us.

03:00:01.468 --> 03:00:02.968
Deedah. I got the deedah.

03:00:30.860 --> 03:00:31.280
A few

03:01:03.900 --> 03:01:15.580
He's a poor little boy, goes for all of them, he's happy.

03:01:38.000 --> 03:01:42.520
Don't you ever go to my lover, I need to be close to you

03:01:42.520 --> 03:01:43.200
Don't

03:02:01.280 --> 03:02:11.110
I don't want to get out.

03:02:33.160 --> 03:02:37.800
O Allah, have mercy on us, the Prophet Muhammad

03:02:37.800 --> 03:02:55.450
O Allah, have mercy on us, the Prophet Muhammad

03:03:01.630 --> 03:03:05.870
I bear witness that there is none worthy of worship except Allah

03:04:58.990 --> 03:04:59.090
Thank you.

03:05:00.470 --> 03:05:02.650
Subhanallah

03:05:02.650 --> 03:05:06.670
Zeebi Adi Malakut

03:05:06.670 --> 03:05:07.730
Kulishai

03:05:07.730 --> 03:05:10.010
Wa ilaih turja

03:06:39.630 --> 03:06:45.610
You will marry Ida.

03:06:45.710 --> 03:06:47.400
Your engagement will be accepted.

03:06:47.700 --> 03:06:49.310
You will be my bride.

03:06:50.640 --> 03:06:51.080
Alhamdulillah.

03:06:51.590 --> 03:06:51.970
Congratulations.

03:06:52.410 --> 03:06:55.020
You will bring your mother here.

03:06:55.340 --> 03:06:58.830
I don't think you will dare to get engaged.

03:07:00.060 --> 03:07:00.760
Thank you, Ngku.

03:07:01.220 --> 03:07:04.830
What are you thanking me for, Bang Buluk?

03:07:04.830 --> 03:07:06.240
Thank you.

03:07:06.260 --> 03:07:07.190
Because of me.

03:07:07.370 --> 03:07:11.000
You can see and feel my story with Ms. Hayati.

03:07:11.160 --> 03:07:13.300
How much I love her.

03:07:14.720 --> 03:07:20.610
You will realize how much Indah Ado is the happiest person in the world.

03:07:20.870 --> 03:07:22.640
Other than the happiness of my love.

03:07:25.990 --> 03:07:27.850
I also thank you, Bang Buluk.

03:07:30.030 --> 03:07:42.180
Maybe I lost Ayah Hati, but always at the time of loss, Bang Buluk was always there as a friend until he died as a friend.

03:07:42.240 --> 03:07:43.830
Until he died as a friend.

03:07:43.930 --> 03:07:48.250
May the deceased be calm in my joy.

03:07:50.020 --> 03:07:54.540
Ayah Hati, Ayah Hati is still alive, Bang Buluk.

03:07:57.010 --> 03:07:57.630
He's still alive.

03:08:03.000 --> 03:08:05.510
Koko, stop being so sad.

03:08:05.870 --> 03:08:07.780
Let bygones be bygones.

03:08:07.920 --> 03:08:10.050
Stop being sad and be happy.

03:08:11.460 --> 03:08:12.420
Almarhum is calm.

03:08:12.800 --> 03:08:14.220
There's a heart that's still alive, Pampun.

03:08:14.280 --> 03:08:18.830
Here, it's still alive.

03:08:19.210 --> 03:08:26.400
Koko yang terbaru.

03:08:31.240 --> 03:08:33.160
With my story and life in this book

03:08:33.160 --> 03:08:36.580
Hopefully this book will be read by many people

03:08:36.580 --> 03:08:40.550
And will also achieve the glory of my nation

03:08:40.550 --> 03:08:43.400
The unity of the land and water

03:08:45.310 --> 03:08:46.870
Disappear all hatred and differences

03:08:49.520 --> 03:08:50.660
Achieve justice and happiness

03:08:50.660 --> 03:08:57.850
The feeling of this big house is tight if only we start

03:09:01.370 --> 03:09:03.150
The path of life is still a long way to go.

03:09:30.540 --> 03:09:31.360
Not yet, I'm not ready yet

03:09:31.360 --> 03:09:58.690
Many people say that this is the true love story between Zainuddin and Hayati

03:10:00.060 --> 03:10:12.970
But for me, this is the true story of the resurrection, about a human child who fell, but chose to rise again, then he fell again, but he chose to rise again.

03:10:13.130 --> 03:10:21.080
Even though he fell many times, Zainuddin chose to live on, rise from his sadness.

03:10:22.950 --> 03:10:27.470
Your fall is not the beginning of your sadness, but the beginning of your resurrection.

03:10:28.800 --> 03:10:29.960
Never let it go.

03:10:30.000 --> 03:10:37.800
When sadness and grief enter you, danger will always be by your side forever.

03:11:01.052 --> 03:11:01.672
Simza.

03:11:10.300 --> 03:11:10.660
So

03:11:31.660 --> 03:11:32.660
Thank you.
